# Waking the Beast (battlefield.waking_the_beast_fullmoon, FullMoonFountain): the requirement arms of MS_Entrance, three level 99
# Warriors registering. main: accepted, the six eyes, no Rainbow Resonator: entryRequirement fails. bob: completed, no key
# items: a registrant needs the key items (a completed char is let in only as a helper): fails. cat: the seven key items, the
# quest never accepted: entryRequirement passes, BattlefieldQuest's quest check fails. Each: message 7355, no menu.
lists FullMoonFountain/MS_Entrance/onTrigger
char zone=FullMoonFountain pos=-301.8,9.5,-260.1 job=WAR lvl=99
char bob zone=FullMoonFountain pos=-301.8,9.5,-260.1 job=WAR lvl=99
char cat zone=FullMoonFountain pos=-301.8,9.5,-260.1 job=WAR lvl=99
quest OtherAreas.WakingTheBeast accepted
keyitem EyeOfFlames
keyitem EyeOfFrost
keyitem EyeOfGales
keyitem EyeOfStorms
keyitem EyeOfTides
keyitem EyeOfTremors
bob: quest OtherAreas.WakingTheBeast completed
cat: keyitem EyeOfFlames
cat: keyitem EyeOfFrost
cat: keyitem EyeOfGales
cat: keyitem EyeOfStorms
cat: keyitem EyeOfTides
cat: keyitem EyeOfTremors
cat: keyitem RainbowResonator
login
trigger MS_Entrance                     # no resonator: refused
bob: login
bob: trigger MS_Entrance                # completed, a registrant: refused
cat: login
cat: trigger MS_Entrance                # the quest not accepted: refused
